    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@126973",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOMERSET.\nHow now, Sir William, whither were you sent?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@126973/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@126973/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 54,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2212660,
        "end": 2212744,
        "line": 81166,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@126973",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_12.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOMERSET.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127061",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCY.\nWhither, my lord? From bought and sold Lord Talbot,\nWho, ring’d about with bold adversity,\nCries out for noble York and Somerset\nTo beat assailing Death from his weak legions;\nAnd whiles the honourable captain there\nDrops bloody sweat from his war-wearied limbs,\nAnd, in advantage lingering, looks for rescue,\nYou, his false hopes, the trust of England’s honour,\nKeep off aloof with worthless emulation.\nLet not your private discord keep away\nThe levied succours that should lend him aid,\nWhile he, renowned noble gentleman,\nYield up his life unto a world of odds.\nOrleans the Bastard, Charles, Burgundy,\nAlençon, Reignier, compass him about,\nAnd Talbot perisheth by your default.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127061/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127061/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127061/line-3",
          "start": 58,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
