    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127856",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOMERSET.\nYork set him on; York should have sent him aid.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127856/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127856/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2213543,
        "end": 2213630,
        "line": 81191,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@127856",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_12.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOMERSET.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127947",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCY.\nAnd York as fast upon your Grace exclaims,\nSwearing that you withhold his levied host\nCollected for this expedition.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127947/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127947/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 48,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127947/line-3",
          "start": 49,
          "end": 91,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@127947/line-4",
          "start": 92,
          "end": 122,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2213634,
        "end": 2213796,
        "line": 81196,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@127947",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_12.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128113",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOMERSET.\nYork lies; he might have sent and had the horse.\nI owe him little duty, and less love,\nAnd take foul scorn to fawn on him by sending.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128113/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128113/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128113/line-3",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128113/line-4",
          "start": 97,
          "end": 143,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2213800,
        "end": 2213983,
        "line": 81203,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@128113",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_12.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOMERSET.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128300",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCY.\nThe fraud of England, not the force of France,\nHath now entrapp’d the noble-minded Talbot.\nNever to England shall he bear his life,\nBut dies betray’d to fortune by your strife.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128300/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 5,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128300/line-2",
          "start": 6,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128300/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 96,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128300/line-4",
          "start": 97,
          "end": 137,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128300/line-5",
          "start": 138,
          "end": 182,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2213987,
        "end": 2214214,
        "line": 81210,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@128300",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_12.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "LUCY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128531",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "SOMERSET.\nCome, go; I will dispatch the horsemen straight.\nWithin six hours they will be at his aid.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128531/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 9,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128531/line-2",
          "start": 10,
          "end": 58,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128531/line-3",
          "start": 59,
          "end": 100,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 2214218,
        "end": 2214353,
        "line": 81218,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap12/p@128531",
        "anchor": "sceneIV_12.4"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "SOMERSET.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "the-first-part-of-henry-the-sixth/sceneIV_12.4/p@128670",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "LUCY.\nToo late comes rescue; he is ta’en or slain,\nFor fly he could not if he would have fled;\nAnd fly would Talbot never, though he might.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
